<p id="mwJg"><b id="mwJw">Basic helix-loop-helix family, member a9</b> is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Protein" title="Protein" id="mwKA">protein</a> in humans that is encoded by the BHLHA9 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Gene" title="Gene" id="mwKQ">gene</a>.<sup about="#mwt26" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-entrez_5-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"entrez"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-entrez-5"}}'><a href="./BHLHA9#cite_note-entrez-5" id="mwKg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLA">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLQ">]</span></span></a></sup> This protein is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Transcription_factor" title="Transcription factor" id="mwLg">transcription factor</a> that is involved in the development of limbs through regulating genes related to limb <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Morphogenesis" title="Morphogenesis" id="mwLw">morphogenesis</a>.<sup about="#mwt29" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="./BHLHA9#cite_note-6" id="mwMA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMg">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

